# Bilbo, Thief in the Night: "you may cast" -- the cast is optional. Bot1 bolts Bot2 on turn 1 and casts Bilbo on turn 3.
# On turn 5 Bilbo attacks, the trigger offers the Lightning Bolt in the graveyard, and Bot1 chooses nothing (the
# positive control is bilbo-recasts-a-bolt-from-the-graveyard-and-exiles-it): the Bolt stays in the graveyard, not exiled,
# Bot2 takes only Bilbo's combat damage and the Mountain is still untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Bilbo, Thief in the Night
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bilbo, Thief in the Night.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Bilbo, Thief in the Night)
Bot1.Choose()
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = false
Bot2.Life = 15
